No warranty
-----------

The data is provided as-is. It is transcribed from a source that is itself
edited by volunteers, and its known gaps are documented rather than hidden:
3,095 players have no recorded position, 460 have a position that disagrees
with their Wikipedia infobox, and 401 have no birth year. See
`data/dist/reports/` and the data-quality page of the site.
